<!--Our History-->
<div class="container-history">
    <iframe width="100%" height="100%"
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/tgbNymZ7vqY?autoplay=1&mute=1">
    </iframe>

    <div class="history-text">
        <h2>Our History</h2>
        <p>(CHAI) is a non-stock, non-profit organization that assists poor Filipinos by bringing various opportunities that can help them improve their living conditions. Established in January 2008, it has targeted poverty issues including access to good quality education, livelihood, improved health and nutrition, and responsible harnessing and utilization of natural resources.  CHAI greatly believes in empowering the people through capacity building for a more sustainable development and values the ideas and concerns of all stakeholders. It believes in character development as a significant tool in bringing forth justice, equality, and transparency among communities effecting improvement of the quality of life.</p>
    </div>
</div>
    
<!--SDGs-->
<div class="container-sdgs">
    <div class="sdgs-header">
        <h1>CHAI-TAGUIG IN ACTION</h1>
        <h4>"Turning vision into action through sustainable development."</h4>
    </div>

    <div class="sdgs-portion">
        <div class="sdg-2">
            <img src="images/sdg_2.png" alt="SDG 2">
            <p>Through our livelihood initiatives, we envision empowered communities capable of sustaining their own needs and improving the quality of life.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sdg-4">
            <img src="images/sdg_4.png" alt="SDG 4">
            <p>Believing in education as the foundation of growth, we aim to cultivate learners who are equipped with the skills, values, and confidence to shape a better future.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sdgs-ending">
        <p>At CHAI-Taguig, we work towards a world wherein no individual gets left behind. Together, we are guided by our commitment to serve and build communities of hope, learning, and opportunity for all women and children.</p>
    </div>
    
</div>

<!--Challenges & Goals Portion-->
<div class="container-challenges-goals">
    <div class="challenges">
        <div class="challenges-header"><h2>Challenges We Face</h2></div>
        <ul>
            <li>Cooperation of the Parents</li>
            <li>“Culture of Silence”</li>
            <li>Crab Mentality</li>
            <li>Lack of proper income</li>
            <li>There are still cases of Teenage Pregnancy</li>
            <li>Lack of follow up on their studies</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="goals">
        <ul>
            <li>A Sustainable Program</li>
            <li>Daycare Center Registration</li>
            <li>Batang Gift of Love to be a role model to the community</li>
            <li>Be a catalyst, be a medium of change</li>
            <li>The children will be able to finish their education and have a good income in the future</li>
            <li>Wider partnerships and networking</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="goals-header"><h2>Our Current Goals</h2></div>
    </div>
</div>

